<h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lead">Found a bug, have an idea for an improvement, or need a new tool? Let us know. Your feedback is the most valuable input for fixing tools and building new ones.</p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="mailto:gemini2k@naver.com">gemini2k@naver.com</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="upd">We usually reply within 3 business days (Korea time). Messages in English, Chinese or Japanese are welcome.</p>

    <h2>When reporting a bug</h2>
    <p>Including the following helps us find the cause much faster.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The tool name or address (e.g. https://gemini2k.co.kr/en/base64.html)</li>
      <li>Your browser and device (e.g. Chrome / Windows, Safari / iPhone)</li>
      <li>What you entered, what you expected, and what actually happened</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Please do not send real data containing personal information or confidential work material.</strong> Made-up example values that reproduce the problem are enough.</p>

    <h2>Suggesting a new tool</h2>
    <p>Just tell us about a task you keep doing by hand. Repetitive work from public-sector IT, IT audit, security, privacy and geospatial practice gets priority.</p>

